---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partner Disclosure | ColitisHelpUSA.com"
  description="Learn how Colitis Help USA works with care-navigation partners and what happens when you submit your information."
  canonical="/partner-disclosure"
>
  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: #0B2545">Partner Disclosure</h1>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: #5C5C56">
      <p>Colitis Help USA may refer users to selected care-navigation services, healthcare partners, or service providers. When you submit a form on this website, your information may be shared with these partners, who may contact you about UC-related care, insurance navigation, or clinical trial opportunities.</p>
      <p>You will only be contacted by partners whose services are relevant to the information you provided. You can request to opt out at any time by contacting us.</p>
      <p>Colitis Help USA does not guarantee the quality, safety, or outcomes of any partner service. We encourage all users to independently verify any information provided by partner organizations and to consult a licensed healthcare provider before making any medical decisions.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
